    <comment>- Update to version 1.101.0i fix bsc#1278303 (CVE-2026-84377):
  * New core runtime dependencies:
    - python-boto3 &gt;= 1.43.1 (new in 1.101.0, non-optional)
    - python-pydantic-settings &gt;= 2.14.1
